Purpose-limitation flags

Reusing production submissions, photographs, profiles, or outputs for product research, portfolios, demonstrations, marketing, or model training is a new purpose and is not authorised by the original service request.

Reference images found online or copied from social platforms may have been collected for a different purpose. Availability online is not permission for MIRA to process or republish them.

Production personal data must not enter GitHub, presentation decks, classroom screenshots, or sample reports. Use synthetic or irreversibly redacted examples.

